on getHash (password, groupName) {
	«Create a hashed string consisting of the password and the membership group name.
		«04/10/00; 11:52:58 AM by PBS
		«Changes
			«8/8/02; 2:55:23 PM by JES
				«Support for passwords stored as binaries instead of as clear-text strings.
	
	local (s = string (password) + string.lower (groupName)); //make groupName case insensitive
	s = string.hashMD5 (s);
	return (s)}